WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
As for the marriage proposal

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,480
I can't help you

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,400
Don't mention it again in the future

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,540
Mr. Fang, you

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,900
Make Miss Ping'er laugh

6
00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:16,870
I really thought the young master was going to sign just now

7
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,670
Do you really think that I am a three-year-old child?

8
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:21,800
Prince, don't worry

9
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,800
I will definitely rescue you

10
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,560
Even if you want to complain

11
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,040
No matter what

12
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:37,300
Do you know what girl you are talking about?

13
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,340
I understand your wishes, but don’t worry

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,500
No need for you to complain

15
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,700
Not less than two days

16
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:46,520
That’s good, I can go out now.

17
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,440
Ping'er will wait for the young master to come out.

18
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,760
Take care, sir
